  "text": "forall\n.CurrentCulture = \"English\" let us solve the problem step by step:\n\n1. Identify the numbers in the rows after each row:\n    row \"0\" = 1\n    row \"1\" = -1,1\n    row \"2\" = -1,0,1\n    row \"3\" = -1,-1,1,1\n    row \"4\" = -1,-2,0,2,1\n    row \"5\" = -1,-3,-1,3,1,1\n    row \"6\" = -1,-4,-2,-4,-1,4,1,1\n\n2. Calculate the separation by subtracting the numbers of row $n$ to row $n-1$.\n    row \"0\" - row \"1\" = 0\n    row \"1\" = -1,1\n    row \"2\" = -1,0,1 \n    row \"3\" = -1,-1,1,1\n    row \"4\" = -1,-2,0,2,1\n    row \"5\" = -1,-3,-1,3,1,1\n    row \"6\" = -1,-4,-2,-4,-1,4,1,1\n    row \"6\" - row \"5\" = -1,-3,-1,3,1,1\n\n3. Separate these numbers into two parts: positive and negative. \n    Positive parts = {-1,-2,0,3,1,4,1}\n    Negative parts = {1,-1,-1,-1,1,1,1}\n\n4. Examine these numbers individually, and measure the absolute value of each part:\n\n   |-1| = 1\n   |2| = 2\n   |0| = 0\n   |3| = 3\n   |1| = 1\n   |4| = 4\n   |1| = 1\n\n5. Add the absolute values together, to find $a8$.\n$a8$ can be found using the summation (Σ) of the absolute values of the numbers inside the brackets:\n\n$a8 = Σ:$|${4,3,1,0,1,1,1}$\n$a8$= $|4| + |1| + |3| + |1| + |0|+ |1| + |1|=\\boxed{11}$\n\n6. As a last step, calculate the denominator $\\log_{10}2$.\n\nTo think harder to figure out how to do this, look strictly at the symbols in front of the brackets. The symbols have a denominator of whatever number comes outside each square bracket. Each answer in the square bracket will have a denominator to which the exponent of their absolute value will correlate. For example if you were to count the squares as exponents, you will find that any row and column $.5$ will still occupy the numerators and have the same other exponents. This results in sum of exponents of a member with the same base being equal to expressions similar to the numerator of a fraction inside brackets.\n\nTherefore the numerator has:\n$\n(1.0)^{15} + (4.5)^{3} + (6.25)^{1} = \\boxed{1.0 + 91.125 + 6.25} = \\boxed{97.375}$",
